{"id": "general-hospital-architect-fee-settlement", "title": "A hospital design change missed a vote. A later settlement ran both ways.", "seconds": 42.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "adad93bbe9713d56", "words": 132, "beats": [{"scene": "b", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A hospital design contract changed by more than a million dollars.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.48, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "approved", "the", "change?"], "sub": "San Francisco General Hospital"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.6, 0.99, 1.51, 1.82, 2.0, 2.19, 2.36, 2.47, 2.81]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Five firms had responded to the original request for qualifications.", "t0": 3.6, "t1": 6.95, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "5 firms", "label": "Qualifications request"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.6, 0.72, 1.2, 1.31, 1.45, 1.88, 2.27, 2.42]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Public Works approved the change in 2011. Supervisors did not.", "t0": 7.07, "t1": 11.05, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "historic-adoption", "kicker": "The seventh modification", "text": "May 3, 2011", "mark": "2011"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.59, 0.94, 1.06, 1.4, 1.5, 1.81, 2.72, 3.52, 3.72]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The analyst traced the missed vote to an administrative error.", "t0": 11.17, "t1": 13.91, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "historic-analysis", "kicker": "Public Works explanation", "text": "Administrative error", "mark": "error"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.55, 0.85, 0.98, 1.28, 1.57, 1.71, 1.8, 2.45]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Supervisors ratified the change in January 2013. All eleven voted yes.", "t0": 14.03, "t1": 18.91, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "11 votes", "label": "January 2013"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.78, 1.2, 1.3, 1.62, 1.73, 2.22, 2.5, 3.51, 3.81, 4.17, 4.49]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Years later, the City sued the architects over the hospital design.", "t0": 19.13, "t1": 22.56, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "settlement", "kicker": "City complaint", "text": "April 11, 2019", "mark": "2019"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 0.81, 0.96, 1.26, 1.53, 1.67, 2.2, 2.4, 2.51, 2.93]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The architects had a claim of their own for unpaid fees.", "t0": 22.68, "t1": 25.27, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "settlement", "kicker": "Architects’ cross-complaint", "text": "Unpaid architectural fees", "mark": "fees"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.62, 0.76, 0.84, 1.12, 1.2, 1.41, 1.6, 1.77, 2.14]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The settlement called for $7.35 million to the City.", "t0": 25.49, "t1": 29.12, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$7.35 million", "label": "Incoming settlement amount"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.58, 0.83, 0.99, 1.33, 1.64, 1.95, 2.31, 2.67, 3.02, 3.15, 3.26]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "It also called for $750,000 to the architect.", "t0": 29.24, "t1": 32.75, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$750,000", "label": "Outgoing settlement amount"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.54, 0.81, 0.96, 1.29, 1.61, 1.98, 2.41, 2.77, 2.9, 3.04]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The City’s voucher shows the payment to the architects.", "t0": 32.87, "t1": 35.41, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "payout", "kicker": "Controller voucher", "text": "Judgments and claims", "mark": "claims"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.5, 0.9, 1.19, 1.31, 1.67, 1.8, 1.95]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "A Treasury deposit would confirm receipt of the money owed to the City.", "t0": 35.53, "t1": 38.86, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "settlement", "kicker": "Incoming amount", "text": "Payment to the City", "mark": "City"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.56, 1.05, 1.23, 1.7, 2.06, 2.14, 2.27, 2.56, 2.75, 2.86, 2.98]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 38.98, "t1": 41.09, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.79, 1.03, 1.11, 1.21, 1.47, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"b": "Approval of the change", "c": "Competing claims", "s": "Two settlement payments"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "number"}